{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0294_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9222ad510450f9ce615cca7fb3c886aadd80062391752f90c30b57d95bfae4b1", "ja": "（現実と見紛うほどリアルなVRゲームの中で、\nアイドル達がライブをする事になった）", "zh": "（在真实得让人难辨真假的VR游戏中，偶像们要举办演唱会了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0294_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3c8ac4081642b36eb4aa1ecab7b8bfe19dc8d752edb26854695afd81380b71f5", "ja": "（ステージ用の楽器を手に入れるため、\nジュリアとVR内のバザールにやってきている……）", "zh": "（为了获得舞台用的乐器，我和茱莉亚来到了VR中的集市……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0294_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "aadf3db4d15212a493a17b3bdc70b7b5fc446211feb33bc0e3088ea63027a080", "ja": "へぇ、結構色々あるんだな……。\n武器として使える楽器とかも、あるみたいだ。", "zh": "哦，还真是有各种各样的东西啊……\n好像还有些能当作武器使用的乐器。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0294_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ed58a3344862fbaee65ec74d2dbf64da187b77a81458ace2a8d327571f323b9b", "ja": "こうやってマーケットを見て回るだけでも楽しいよな。\nいいライブにするためにも、じっくり探そうか。", "zh": "像这样逛逛市场也挺开心的。为了办一场精彩的演出，咱们慢慢找找吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0294_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "c90e275448de90879f02fb7653a0de21a6c306e8b418bc087aae345f5d9b3c6c", "ja": "ああ。それじゃお言葉に甘えて……。\nおっ！　あのギター、面白いデザインだな！", "zh": "啊。那我就恭敬不如从命了……\n哦！那把吉他的设计真有意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0294_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "29b43471f1598a060f209cce257e372f1ff7749526abaf8528697c3e27d33281", "ja": "おいおい、ピックまであるぞ！？\n投げて攻撃したりするのかな？　あははっ！", "zh": "喂喂，连拨片都有啊！？\n难道还能扔出去攻击吗？啊哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0294_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "4cef84755662c471900e7c287e112614d0d8d7dd83de4bda328870ef9ba7187a", "ja": "いや～、まさかここまで楽器が充実してるとは……！\nいくら見てても飽きないぜ♪", "zh": "哎呀～没想到连乐器都齐全到这种程度……！\n不管看多久都不会腻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0294_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "cb101565c99748f31e03dd368a7df36e7abf0cd8d862958048ce0f5be9b8475a", "ja": "おっ、あれはギターの仕込み刀！\nいいね、使いやすそうだ。ちょっと抜いてみるか♪", "zh": "哦，那是藏在吉他里的刀！\n不错，看起来挺好用的。要不要稍微拔出来看看♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0294_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8ca49d16e8f7ba1a562ed862219bc412cceb28a84a6afb74e6df42f5ecb643c3", "ja": "いいけど……いくらなんでも、そろそろ戻らないと。\n他の準備もあるし。", "zh": "可以是可以……但不管怎么说，也差不多该回去了。\n还有其他准备要做呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0294_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "6a69880595c067c5ba45b3c426e451dff62489bcf6544146ef35e7f979bbe9eb", "ja": "っと、そうだった！\n悪い、つい夢中になっちゃってさ。", "zh": "对了，差点忘了！\n抱歉，一不小心就入迷了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0294_1011_p", "source_sha256": "01a3dd0c760d1f2697845471b0ffb2bb4eff21b9ea4e6a3b6212af605381986e", "ja": "それで、どれを買うのか決めたのか？", "zh": "那么，你决定好要买哪把了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0294_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "cc4dbc10be8e190fc52b6d86c4edd8bd00b0ce80e629e00cc3de01318cf73c93", "ja": "そうだな……うん、このシンプルなギターでいい。\n……おーい、店の人！　これ貰いたいんだけど。", "zh": "是啊……嗯，就这把朴素的吉他吧。\n……喂——店里的人！我想要这把。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0294_1013_rotensyou", "source_sha256": "ad13e32ffa126fce086bf9fbcba865d204c5325f2caa6975ae2fd0b5589d74a6", "ja": "おっ？　お客さん、お目が高いね～。\nそれはうちの楽器で、一番いいヤツだ！", "zh": "哦？客人，您真有眼光～。\n那可是我们店里最好的乐器！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0294_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "9e158371d74f661ac1957992b03e42ab93c5ebce8678f767ad22bf7fa48bf90e", "ja": "へえ、そうなのか。まいったな、さすがあたし……\nって、なんだよこの値段！　ゼロが多すぎる！！", "zh": "嘿，原来是这样啊。真拿自己没办法，不愧是我……\n等等，这价格是怎么回事！零也太多了吧！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0294_1015_rotensyou", "source_sha256": "8db99fa4ef461ff8a67f4d3d90be849050fb7e2c8c3ed996dfe90d391fc06a14", "ja": "レア装備だしな。相場より安いんだよ、これでも。", "zh": "毕竟是稀有装备。即便如此，价格还是比行情便宜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0294_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "3b4080ae21b60b5baa3083b07c087156ea098d760f48b07559578abbcda8422f", "ja": "くっ……！　琴葉やミズキに借りるか？\nいや、でもな……。", "zh": "呜……！要不要去向琴叶或者瑞希借点钱？\n不，还是算了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0294_1017_p", "source_sha256": "da5cb3cf7fa931ee3d35e411268b04fe31a0c85dd670fb0970fcaa71e9ed89b2", "ja": "うーん……仕方ないから、\nもう少し安いギターにしたらどうだ？", "zh": "嗯……没办法，要不换把便宜点的吉他？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0294_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "982e02ad57a6c3179bea5ed2f8f45bd2904923ced5a1c2dc81a00bccf60f3e7c", "ja": "まあそうだよな、現実的に考えたら。\nけど……このギター、いい音なんだよな……くぅ。", "zh": "也是啊，现实一点考虑的话。\n可是……这把吉他的音色真的很棒啊……唔唔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0294_1019_rotensyou", "source_sha256": "29f31cfb2aeb382e6f654f2d7fea75b3c52c024b0a0dfea6b81c2da2031c8e87", "ja": "………。\nお客さん、ギター弾けるの？", "zh": "……。\n客人，你会弹吉他吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0294_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "75a7b29a7e62b7d64fe7db250c6987fc22fddf669dff225556c796fd3eadebd3", "ja": "え？　あ、ああ、まあ……弾けるけど。", "zh": "咦？啊，嗯……会弹是会弹。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0294_1021_rotensyou", "source_sha256": "c17b460a1fe2339cb2578374dbaae011865e3732bc651459e32a06e90ec89579", "ja": "だったら、そのギターで一曲演ってみてよ。\n感動させてくれたら、タダであげるよ。どう？", "zh": "既然这样，那就用那把吉他演奏一曲给我听听吧。\n要是能打动我，就免费送给你。怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0294_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "3b071f701086d1cc39100052e7abace4e0b25f196f5a0e19564c8c483494fc32", "ja": "え、いいのかよ？　レア装備なのに？\nマジか……なかなかロックじゃん！　へへっ♪", "zh": "诶，真的可以吗？明明是稀有装备啊？\n真的吗……还挺摇滚的嘛！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0294_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "394e8b9bff4a78f52e3eca71cc4b39dab95d9f795cf1df718c8421101e32ed94", "ja": "わかった、一曲演らせてもらう。\nけど……ギターだけか？　歌ってもいいんだよな？", "zh": "知道了，那就让我演奏一曲吧。\n不过……只有吉他吗？我也可以唱的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0294_1024_rotensyou", "source_sha256": "7636a8f16670fc2cbbbfcd0e080880ac82511f6bc5af0d62449296f4b07b9d7b", "ja": "え？　そりゃ、まあ……。\n歌も聴かせてくれるなら、その方が嬉しいけど。", "zh": "诶？那当然是……嗯……\n要是还能唱歌给我听的话，我会更高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0294_1025_050jul", "source_sha256": "94c8d9a4880ed79c819d96d06e2940ba39e3da90ceded1adcb3332dabf6aeaf7", "ja": "OK！　んじゃ、弾き語りで。\nへへっ……聴いてくれよ、あたしのロックを！", "zh": "OK！那就边弹边唱吧。\n嘿嘿……听好咯，我的摇滚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0294_1026_p", "source_sha256": "ae8447d68bbb929d18a50309fd26b6e44cdc1a601e526be22b770e8f350da061", "ja": "（気が付けば、人だかりが出来ていて……ジュリアは\n無事、ギターを手に入れた。いい出会いになったな！）", "zh": "（回过神来，周围已经聚起了一群人……茱莉亚也顺利拿到了吉他。真是一次美好的相遇啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
